{"id": 86776, "field": "completion", "ja": "ああ、助かった！これで炉を燃やし続けられるはずだ。いつか、石炭を定期的に町へ運んでくる商人が来てくれるといいんだがな！", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-fvo-quest-sg12@2026-10-03", "imported": "2026-10-03"}, "english": {"hash": "de5ced066b403030", "src": "forever-vo@025070f"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
