{"id": 86797, "field": "objectives", "ja": "UrsolanにいるGatekeeper Rageroarのところへ戻ってください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-r70888-qo-sg12@2026-11-12", "imported": "2026-11-12"}, "english": {"hash": "9a2b8840afffc3df", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70888"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 86797, "field": "description", "ja": "Legashiの拠点が弱った今、我々は名誉を持ってUrsolanへ戻れる。\n\n私より先に行き、Gatekeeper Rageroarにここの状況を伝えてくれ。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-r70888-qd-sg12@2026-11-12", "imported": "2026-11-12"}, "english": {"hash": "08fbf252ea4a2a06", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70888"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
